{"item_uid": "指考補93-geography-001", "sitting": "makeup", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 93, "year_ce": 2004, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "電影中拯救「中土世界」的方法是將魔戒丟入「末日火山」的岩 乙\n漿中，該外景選在紐西蘭最高的活火山，要造訪這個外景應到圖\n1 中的哪個位置？ 丙", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁 丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "1-2", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
